ing score.\nAllowed attribute names: abs, arange, bfloat16, cdiv, constexpr, contiguous, device, dtype, empty, empty_like, exp, exp2, float, float16, float32, full, functional, int32, jit, load, log, max, max_contiguous, maximum, minimum, multiple_of, next_power_of_2, nn, numel, program_id, reshape, rsqrt, shape, sigmoid, silu, sqrt, store, stride, sum, tanh, to, view, where, zeros\nActual exclusive-device profiler observations for the starting BLOCK256/4warps kernel: [{\"t\": 1, \"profiler_feedback\": {\"trace\": \"3-schedule-profile-1.json\", \"kernels\": [{\"name\": \"Kernel\", \"duration_us\": 0.832, \"grid\": [48, 1, 1], \"block\": [128, 1, 1], \"stream\": 7}], \"scope\": \"instrumented CUDA kernel activity; not hardware counters or timing score\"}, \"median_graph_us\": 1.0495999827980995}, {\"t\": 7239, \"profiler_feedback\": {\"trace\": \"3-schedule-profile-7239.json\", \"kernels\": [{\"name\": \"Kernel\", \"duration_us\": 341.915, \"grid\": [347472, 1, 1], \"block\": [128, 1, 1], \"stream\": 7}], \"scope\": \"instrumented CUDA kernel activity; not hardware counters or timing score\"}, \"median_graph_us\": 348.1247901916504}]"
